# Golden handoffs are facilitator- and delivery-specific: they carry live Azure resource
# IDs and an image digest that go stale the moment that environment is torn down.
# Build your own with catalog-migrate render-handoff. See workshop/golden/README.md.
workshop/golden/*/evidence/

# Terraform - state and plans contain the VM administrator password, generated database
